# R1.6 behaviour-table probe: shape (int-preserving; dimension counts)
define nt(x) as:
    try:
        return num_type of x
    catch e:
        return e.kind
a is shape of [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
print of [a, nt of a[0]]
b is shape of (buffer of 4)
print of [b, nt of b[0]]
c is shape of (reshape of [buf_from_list of [1, 2, 3, 4], 2, 2])
print of [c, nt of c[1]]
